{
  "info": {
    "name": "Jasně API",
    "description": "## Setup\n\n1. Right-click collection → **Edit** → **Variables** tab\n2. Set CURRENT VALUE for:\n   - `base_url` — `https://jasne-backend-production.up.railway.app` (или `http://localhost:8000`)\n   - `supabase_url` — `https://<your-ref>.supabase.co` (Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API)\n   - `anon_key` — Supabase **anon** (public) JWT, начинается с `eyJ...`\n3. Save\n\n## Auth flow\n\n- **Register** — один раз создать юзера. Если падает с `429 over_email_send_rate_limit` → создай юзера через Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Users → Add user (Auto Confirm).\n- **Login** — токен автоматом сохранится в `{{token}}`, `user_id` в `{{user_id}}`. Все остальные запросы их подхватят.\n\n## Multi-page scan\n\n1. **Upload Page 1** (Body → file → выбери фотку) → 200\n2. (опционально) Upload Page 2, 3...\n3. **Create Scan** — массив `image_paths: [\"<user_id>/page1.jpg\", ...]`. Лимиты: Free 3 страницы, Pro 10.\n\n## Plans\n\n| | Free | Pro |\n|---|---|---|\n| Сканы/мес | 5 | 100 |\n| Страниц/скан | 3 | 10 |\n| Вопросов/скан | 0 | 10 |\n\nПопытка превысить → HTTP 402. Plan меняется RevenueCat webhook'ом (на сейчас — вручную в Supabase Dashboard → profiles).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://jasne-backend-production.up.railway.app", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "supabase_url", "value": "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "anon_key", "value": "YOUR_ANON_KEY", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_email", "value": "test@jasne.app", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_password", "value": "TestPass123!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "scan_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "deadline_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth (Supabase)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (один раз)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/signup",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "signup"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login → сохраняет token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', json.user.id);",
                  "  console.log('✓ Token saved:', json.access_token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
                  "  console.log('✓ User ID:', json.user.id);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.error('✗ Login failed:', json.error_description || json.msg || JSON.stringify(json));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. System",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health (liveness)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Deep (readiness)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/deep", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health", "deep"] },
            "description": "200 — все ОК. 503 — Supabase или OpenAI лежит, см. deps[].error"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Profile",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["profile"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"language\": \"cs\",\n  \"has_datova_schranka\": true,\n  \"display_name\": \"Test User\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["profile"] },
            "description": "⚠️ plan НЕ обновляется здесь — RevenueCat webhook owns it"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Limits",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Limits (без scan_id)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/limits", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["limits"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Limits (с scan_id — для chat)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/limits?scan_id={{scan_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["limits"],
              "query": [{ "key": "scan_id", "value": "{{scan_id}}" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Scans",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload Page 1 to Storage",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "image/jpeg" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "file", "file": { "src": "" } },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/storage/v1/object/documents/{{user_id}}/page1.jpg",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["storage", "v1", "object", "documents", "{{user_id}}", "page1.jpg"]
            },
            "description": "Body → выбрать **file** → твою фотку. RLS пускает только в свою папку."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Page 2 (multi-page)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "image/jpeg" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "file", "file": { "src": "" } },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/storage/v1/object/documents/{{user_id}}/page2.jpg",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["storage", "v1", "object", "documents", "{{user_id}}", "page2.jpg"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Scan (single page)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 && json.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('scan_id', json.id);",
                  "  console.log('✓ Scan ID:', json.id);",
                  "  console.log('  category:', json.category, '| doc_type:', json.doc_type);",
                  "  console.log('  pages:', json.page_count, '| model:', json.model_used);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.error('✗', JSON.stringify(json));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"image_paths\": [\"{{user_id}}/page1.jpg\"],\n  \"language\": \"cs\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["scans"] },
            "description": "Полный pipeline (5-20 сек): подписать URL → GPT-4o Vision → класс → RAG → analyzer → save + scan_messages + auto-deadlines"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Scan (multi-page)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 && json.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('scan_id', json.id);",
                  "  console.log('✓ Multi-page:', json.id, '| pages:', json.page_count);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"image_paths\": [\n    \"{{user_id}}/page1.jpg\",\n    \"{{user_id}}/page2.jpg\"\n  ],\n  \"language\": \"cs\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["scans"] },
            "description": "Free: max 3 страницы → 4+ возвращает 402. Pro: max 10."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Scan (перевод UK)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"image_paths\": [\"{{user_id}}/page1.jpg\"],\n  \"language\": \"uk\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["scans"] },
            "description": "language ∈ {cs, en, uk, ru} переопределяет язык summary/translation"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Scans",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["scans"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Scan by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans/{{scan_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["scans", "{{scan_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Scan",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans/{{scan_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["scans", "{{scan_id}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Chat (Pro only)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Messages (тред)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans/{{scan_id}}/chat",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["scans", "{{scan_id}}", "chat"]
            },
            "description": "Все сообщения треда: фото (image), карточка результата (result_card), Q&A (text)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ask Question",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  console.log('Q:', j.user_message.content);",
                  "  console.log('A:', j.assistant_message.content);",
                  "  console.log('Used:', j.questions_used, '/ Remaining:', j.questions_remaining);",
                  "} else if (pm.response.code === 402) {",
                  "  console.error('✗ Pro feature — upgrade plan');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Co znamená VS na tomto dokumentu?\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/scans/{{scan_id}}/chat",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["scans", "{{scan_id}}", "chat"]
            },
            "description": "Free → 402. Pro → 201, max 10/scan. Контекст (OCR + result) подкладывается автоматически."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Deadlines",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Active",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines?only_active=true",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["deadlines"],
              "query": [{ "key": "only_active", "value": "true" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List All",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines?only_active=false",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["deadlines"],
              "query": [{ "key": "only_active", "value": "false" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines/{{deadline_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["deadlines", "{{deadline_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create (manual)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('deadline_id', j.id);",
                  "  console.log('✓', j.id, 'auto_created:', j.auto_created);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Zaplatit fakturu\",\n  \"description\": \"Faktura č. 2026/042\",\n  \"due_date\": \"2026-12-15\",\n  \"deadline_type\": \"payment\",\n  \"reminder_days\": [30, 14, 7, 1]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["deadlines"] },
            "description": "Ручное создание (auto_created=false). Auto-deadlines создаются при scan POST."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark Completed",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"completed\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines/{{deadline_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["deadlines", "{{deadline_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update (date/desc)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"due_date\": \"2027-01-15\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines/{{deadline_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["deadlines", "{{deadline_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/deadlines/{{deadline_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["deadlines", "{{deadline_id}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
